      "input": "FastEthernet0:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: INIT\n    Rx state: WAIT PORT OPER\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/1:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: IDLE\n    Rx state: WAIT FOR FRAME\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/2:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: IDLE\n    Rx state: WAIT FOR FRAME\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/3:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: INIT\n    Rx state: WAIT PORT OPER\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/4:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: INIT\n    Rx state: WAIT PORT OPER\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/5:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: INIT\n    Rx state: WAIT PORT OPER\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/6:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: INIT\n    Rx state: WAIT PORT OPER\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/7:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: INIT\n    Rx state: WAIT PORT OPER\n\nGigabitEthernet1/0/8:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: INIT\n    Rx state: WAIT PORT OPER\n\nTenGigabitEthernet1/1/1:\n    Tx: enabled\n    Rx: enabled\n    Tx state: IDLE\n    Rx state: WAIT FOR FRAME\n",
